WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:06.519 --> 00:00:10.080
Phulera ka naya Pradhan Kranti Devi ka aap sabko namaskaar.

00:00:11.119 --> 00:00:13.400
Aap sabhi log Panchayat ka naya season ka

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.960
intezaar kar rahe hain na?

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:16.600
Ka laga aapko?

00:00:16.719 --> 00:00:20.960
 Itni beizzati ke baad, naya season itne aasani se de denge?

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:25.120
Yeh lauki-phauki ka time gaya.

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:29.480
Phulera par ab hoga humara full control.

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:33.159
Humko chahiye full izzat.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.039
Jin haathon se abhi tak memes banaye hain,

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.840
unhi haathon se ab haar pehnana hoga.

00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:46.439
1-2 haar pehnane se kaam nahi chalega,

00:00:46.439 --> 00:00:47.039
bata rahe hain.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.759
50 hazaar haar toh hone hi chahiye.

00:00:48.759 --> 00:00:49.560
Kyu Pradhanji?

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:52.600
Hazaaron-lakh toh humari jooti bhi na maane.

00:00:52.679 --> 00:00:56.000
Kam se kam ek crore haar pehnane honge.

00:00:56.119 --> 00:00:57.479
Ek crore!

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:02.039
Panchayatdate.com pe jaiye

00:01:02.039 --> 00:01:04.040
aur ek crore haar pehnaiye,

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.200
Aur jaldi se jaldi naya season dekhne ke liye

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.319
taiyyar ho jaiye.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.239
Arey jaldi karo, crore aaj hi poora karna hai.

